[Service onStartCommand()] ──► Launches Coroutine Scope (Dispatchers.IO)
                                        │
                                        ▼
    ┌───────────────────► [ Loop Run Pass (Every 10 seconds) ]
    │                                   │
    │                      Checks nativeGetPendingCount()
    │                                   │
    │         ┌─────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┐
    │         ▼ (If Count > 0)                                    ▼ (If Count == 0)
    │   nativePollEvent()                                    Enters delay(10000) block
    │         │                                                   │
    │         ▼                                                   │
    │   Dispatched to server via HttpAnalyticsDispatcher          │
    │         │                                                   │
    │   ┌─────┴────────────────────────┐                          │
    │   ▼ (On Success HTTP 2xx)        ▼ (On Network Failure)     │
    │ nativePopEvent()              delay(5000) & retry later     │
    │   │                              │                          │
    └───┴──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┴◄───┘